  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Welcome to <span>CESUR</span></h1>
    <small>Informatics Vocational Training Center</small>
    <p>
      At CESUR, we shape tomorrow’s IT professionals today. Our center specializes in high-quality, hands-on training in programming, networks, cybersecurity, and web development. Learn from experienced teachers in a dynamic environment that fosters real-world skills, teamwork, and innovation. Start your pathway to an exciting tech career with us!
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="courses">
    <h2>Our courses</h2>
    <div class="courses-inner">
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/101/300" alt="Multiplatform Application Development">
        <div class="card-inner">
          <p>Train to build applications for mobile, desktop and web. Learn Java, Kotlin, Swift and cross-platform frameworks to create apps that run on any device.</p>
          <h4>Multiplatform Application Development</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/102/300" alt="Web Application Development">
        <div class="card-inner">
          <p>Master frontend and backend web technologies. HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, Node.js, Express and databases to build dynamic, responsive websites and web applications.</p>
          <h4>Web Application Development</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/103/300" alt="IT Systems Administration">
        <div class="card-inner">
          <p>Learn to install, configure and maintain servers and networks. Linux, Windows Server, virtualization, cloud services and IT infrastructure management.</p>
          <h4>IT Systems Administration</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/104/300" alt="Microcomputer Systems and Networks">
        <div class="card-inner">
          <p>PC hardware assembly and repair, operating systems, local networks, cabling and technical support. Become a computer systems technician.</p>
          <h4>Microcomputer Systems and Networks</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="slideshow">
    <h2>Campus life</h2>
    <div class="slideshow-inner">
      <!-- Ventana visible: recorta todo lo que queda fuera del track -->
      <div class="slideshow-track">
        <div class="slide active">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1050/1200/500" alt="Students working on a project">
          <div class="slide-caption">
            <h4>Hands-on learning</h4>
            <p>Our students build real projects from day one, working in teams on the same tools used by the industry.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="slide">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1060/1200/500" alt="Computer lab at CESUR">
          <div class="slide-caption">
            <h4>Modern facilities</h4>
            <p>Fully equipped computer labs, networking racks and server rooms where theory becomes practice.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="slide">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1070/1200/500" alt="Students at a technology event">
          <div class="slide-caption">
            <h4>Industry connections</h4>
            <p>Workshops, hackathons and internships with local tech companies to launch your career.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Copia del primer slide: permite cerrar el bucle sin salto visible -->
        <div class="slide" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1050/1200/500" alt="Students working on a project">
          <div class="slide-caption">
            <h4>Hands-on learning</h4>
            <p>Our students build real projects from day one, working in teams on the same tools used by the industry.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="facilities">
    <div class="facilities-inner">
      <div class="facilities-row">
        <div class="facilities-image">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1080/800/600" alt="CESUR computer lab">
        </div>
        <div class="facilities-text">
          <h2>Our Facilities</h2>
          <p>
            CESUR offers modern, fully equipped facilities designed for hands-on
            training in informatics. Our computer labs feature the latest hardware
            and software, networking racks, server rooms and collaborative
            workspaces where students develop real-world skills from day one.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Computer labs with up-to-date workstations</li>
            <li>Networking and server infrastructure</li>
            <li>Cybersecurity practice environment</li>
            <li>Collaborative study and project areas</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="facilities-row facilities-row--reverse">
        <div class="facilities-image">
          <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1081/800/600" alt="CESUR networking lab">
        </div>
        <div class="facilities-text">
          <h2>Practical Training</h2>
          <p>
            Students learn in real-world environments that simulate professional
            IT workplaces. From configuring enterprise networks to securing
            systems against cyber threats, every lab session builds the practical
            experience employers look for.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Hands-on networking and server labs</li>
            <li>Cybersecurity defense and attack simulations</li>
            <li>Hardware assembly and maintenance workshops</li>
            <li>Team-based project development rooms</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  
  <section class="slideshow-fade">
    <h2>Student experiences</h2>
    <div class="slideshow-fade-inner">
      <!-- Los slides se apilan en el mismo espacio y se alternan con un fundido -->
      <div class="fade-slide">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1005/900/500" alt="Student testimonial">
        <div class="slide-caption">
          <p>"The hands-on projects helped me land my first developer job before finishing the course."</p>
          <h4>Laura Gómez — DAW graduate</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-slide">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1011/900/500" alt="Student testimonial">
        <div class="slide-caption">
          <p>"The teachers know the industry first-hand and guide you through every project."</p>
          <h4>Daniel Ruiz — DAM graduate</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="fade-slide">
        <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1027/900/500" alt="Student testimonial">
        <div class="slide-caption">
          <p>"I learned to manage real networks and servers, and I am now working as a systems technician."</p>
          <h4>Marta Sanz — ASIR graduate</h4>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

